        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "A standard roof replacement in Utah costs between $8,500 and $25,000. For a typical 2,000-square-foot home with architectural asphalt shingles, most homeowners pay around $12,000 to $18,000. Final totals depend on roof size, pitch, material selection, and local factors like snow load or regional labor differences.",
